{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLEANSTART-2026-HO34252","published":"2026-11-14T00:37:03.277651Z","modified":"2026-11-14T00:45:06.972054913Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-118515"],"summary":"Symfony Serializer component DataUriNormalizer handles only the exact types SplFileInfo, SplFileObject, and File, so for a property typed with a subclass such as UploadedFile, ObjectNormalizer inst...","details":"Security vulnerability affects the drupal package. The Symfony Serializer component DataUriNormalizer handles only the exact types SplFileInfo, SplFileObject, and File, so for a property typed with a subclass such as UploadedFile, ObjectNormalizer instantiates the object through its constructor from attacker-controlled data, including the file path.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"drupal","ecosystem":"CleanStart","purl":"pkg:apk/cleanstart/drupal?arch=noarch"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"11.4.11-r0"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cleanstart-dev/cleanstart-security-advisories/blob/main/advisories/2026/CLEANSTART-2026-HO34252.json"}},{"package":{"name":"drupal","ecosystem":"CleanStart","purl":"pkg:apk/cleanstart/drupal?arch=noarch"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"11.1.10-r0"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cleanstart-dev/cleanstart-security-advisories/blob/main/advisories/2026/CLEANSTART-2026-HO34252.json"}},{"package":{"name":"drupal","ecosystem":"CleanStart","purl":"pkg:apk/cleanstart/drupal?arch=noarch"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"11.2.14-r0"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cleanstart-dev/cleanstart-security-advisories/blob/main/advisories/2026/CLEANSTART-2026-HO34252.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/cleanstart-dev/cleanstart-security-advisories/tree/main/advisories/2026/CLEANSTART-2026-HO34252.json"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://osv.dev/vulnerability/CVE